  "display_title": "Monster Streamer for Gods",
  "description": "In Gang-Sik Choi’s world, monster attacks are a common occurrence. Humanity is protected by hunters with superpowers who stream their fights online, and it is Gang-Sik’s job to get it all on camera as the cameraman for a below-average monster streamer. In a stream gone wrong, he suddenly finds himself in front of the camera… but human viewers aren’t the only ones watching him. Now, he is a streamer for the Gods, and more viewers mean more power. With monsters at every turn, how long can Gang-Sik keep the cameras rolling? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
